A: "10+ years ago\nIndieAuth (h-app microformats)" {class: early}
B: "early 2020s\nSolid-OIDC (Client Identifier Document, JSON-LD)" {class: early}
C: "2024\nAT Protocol / Bluesky adopts a URL client_id" {class: cimd}
D: "2025-09\nOAuth WG adopts draft-parecki (CIMD)" {class: cimd}
E: "2025-11\nMCP makes CIMD the recommended default" {class: cimd}
F: "2026-03\ndraft-ietf-oauth-client-id-metadata-document-01" {class: cimd}

A -> B -> C -> D -> E -> F
